The driver provides support for Kyocera AIR‐EDGE PHONE AH‐K3001V.
Two  units  of this driver attach to an AIR‐EDGE PHONE: the modem
port and the data transfer port.  The modem port is compatible to
and can be used for dialup connections.  The data  transfer  port
is  for  reading  and writing internal storage of AIR‐EDGE PHONE.
